  "version": "0.1.0",
  "author": "idv7lol contributors",
  "description": "Inspired by the round dials of late-80s and 90s BMW clusters: a speedometer and a tachometer with chrome bezels and orange-red needles, small fuel and temperature dials inside them, a row of check lamps, a gear window between the dials, a green-yellow-red row of lamps for the oil warming up, and an amber on-board computer with the time, outside temperature, range and odometer. Amber night lighting, white day lighting, or red.",
